mlxflow 0.8; events
1. On File               inbox/; pattern=*.pdf; settle=30s
2. Read Files            inbox/; pattern=*.pdf
3. <each read_one; on_error=skip>   [file] -> [text]
     1. Read PDF   (input:1)
4. Join Text
5. Split                 chunk_size=500; overlap=50
6. Embed                 BGE-M3
7. Store Index   (5,6)   library.index
